     "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-vmw.txt",
     "text": "Okhala wira osaamiha n’edignidade ya kunla pinatamu n’editeito sawe soolikana ni sakhwawe eri variyari wa eliberdade, wa esaria ni murettele mulumwenkuni;"
    }
