     "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-vmw.txt",
     "text": "Edireito ela en’himya wira mutthu ula poti ohiya egreja eri awe khukela entthuna awe, nnakhala moota ontthokekelawe, mekhawe walaa onari n’akhwawe, asomihaka walaa amulonpaka muluku."
